":"CLLocationCoordinate2D"},{"text":" instances. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"points in the collection may be related but are not connected spatially. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"example, you could use a point collection to represent all the trees in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"orchard.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNPointCollection"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpointcollection","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointCollection","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MLNPointCollection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","title":"MLNShape","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShape","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}]}}}